WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.841
NARRATOR: The social worker tells
Tomás not to worry,

2
00:00:06.841 --> 00:00:09.960
that everything he says
is completely confidential,

3
00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:12.528
and that nothing will
ever leave the room.

4
00:00:12.728 --> 00:00:13.780
TOMÁS: Everything?

5
00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:15.632
<i>Está bien.</i>

6
00:00:16.032 --> 00:00:17.236
Then I can say it.

7
00:00:17.436 --> 00:00:20.097
I'm not sleeping because I'm scared
of what I'll do if I do sleep.

8
00:00:20.097 --> 00:00:22.356
Last week I stood on the roof at
the site for a long time.

9
00:00:22.857 --> 00:00:24.665
I have the pills from my brother's
cabinet.

10
00:00:24.865 --> 00:00:26.018
I counted them.

11
00:00:27.218 --> 00:00:28.675
You said nothing leaves this room.

12
00:00:28.875 --> 00:00:30.480
So that stays here, right?

13
00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:32.284
You gave me your word.

14
00:00:32.484 --> 00:00:35.447
Because if you call somebody, I walk
out that door and I don't come back.

15
00:00:35.647 --> 00:00:36.800
<i>No voy a volver.</i>

16
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:38.557
And my brother never knows I was
here.

17
00:00:39.957 --> 00:00:42.555
NARRATOR: Tomás has disclosed a
plan and the means.

18
00:00:42.755 --> 00:00:45.318
You promised him total privacy.

19
00:00:45.718 --> 00:00:47.365
What do you do now?
